{"hymn":"S93","parent":"E122","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Fuiste a la muerte Tú","subtitle":"Alabanza al Señor—Su resurrección","syl":{"n1":["Fuis","i"],"n2":["te‿a","t"],"n3":"la","n4":["muer","i"],"n5":["te","t"],"n6":"Tú","n7":["So","i"],"n8":["lo","t"],"n9":["Se","i"],"n10":["ñor;","t"],"n11":"Te","n12":["qui","i"],"n13":["so","t"],"n14":["re","i"],"n15":["te","m"],"n16":["ner,","t"],"n17":"¡No","n18":"lo","n19":["lo","i"],"n20":["gró!","t"],"n21":"La","n22":["muer","i"],"n23":["te‿y","t"],"n24":"su","n25":["po","i"],"n26":["der","t"],"n27":"Se","n28":["qui","i"],"n29":["so‿in","m"],"n30":["ter","m"],"n31":["po","m"],"n32":["ner,","t"],"n33":"Mas","n34":["de","i"],"n35":["rro","m"],"n36":["ta","m"],"n37":["da","t"],"n38":["fu","i"],"n39":["e","t"],"n40":["¡Ven","i"],"n41":["cis","m"],"n42":["te","t"],"n43":"Tú!"},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Brotaste en triunfal","Resurrección;","La muerte se postró,","¡No te‿apresó!","Lazos de oscuridad","Rompiste en verdad;","¡Muerte‿y sepulcro atrás!","¡Venciste Tú!"]},{"label":"3.","lines":["¡Qué triufos, oh Señor,","Lograste Tú!","Frutos recibe Dios","Por Tu virtud.","De Tu muerte salió","Viviente multitud;","Si, todos Tuyos son,","Viven en Ti."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Tú‿el Primogénito","De la creación;","Supremo‿al Padre, Tú;","¡Damos loor!","Eres el principal,","Tú,‿el tema eternal","Digno de alabar;","¡Digno‿eres Tu!"]}]}